# What the CLI uploads when deploying by hand.
#
# The Git-source path (the GitHub Action) never reads this — Vercel clones the
# repo itself. It matters only for `vercel --prod` from a laptop, where without
# it the CLI tries to upload the whole working tree: 1.7 GB of mobile
# node_modules, 1.3 GB of Android build output and a 520 MB .next, which trips
# the 100 MB per-file limit long before it finishes.

node_modules
.next
.git

# The Expo app is a separate workspace Vercel never builds. packages/ is
# deliberately absent: the web app compiles that code, so it has to ship.
mobile

# Design canvases and handoff material: source for people, not for the build.
design
handoff 3
mobile copy

*.log
.DS_Store
